      "content": "i feel like i'm just waiting for something that's never coming back. it's like i'm stuck in this loop of just existing but not actually living. i look at everything around me and it all just seems so meaningless and heavy. sometimes i think maybe the silence is better than this constant ache. it feels like there's no way to get back to how things were, and maybe things aren't even meant to be okay again.",
